From: Andy Zhang and contributors (see kernel/third-party/README.md for imported parts)
Subject: [PATCH 0002/8] MSM display (DPU/MDSS) support for SM4450

DPU catalog for SM4450 (DPU 8.6), DSC, boot-scanout handling, MDSS tweaks.
Imported from ROCKNIX (0009 etc.), adapted; see kernel/third-party/README.md.

Apply with: git apply (from the root of a Linux 7.3 tree).
---
